  "notes": "Countdown gives you a transition effect when you change a number between 0 to 999.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/countdown/+page.md",
  "code": "<div class=\"grid auto-cols-max grid-flow-col gap-5 text-center\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n    <span class=\"countdown font-mono text-5xl\">\n      <span style=\"--value:15;\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"15\">15</span>\n    </span>\n    days\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n    <span class=\"countdown font-mono text-5xl\">\n      <span style=\"--value:10;\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"10\">10</span>\n    </span>\n    hours\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n    <span class=\"countdown font-mono text-5xl\">\n      <span style=\"--value:24;\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"24\">24</span>\n    </span>\n    min\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n    <span class=\"countdown font-mono text-5xl\">\n      <span style=\"--value:59;\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"59\">59</span>\n    </span>\n    sec\n  </div>\n</div>",
